msgid "快速入门"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "项目介绍"
msgstr "Project Introduction"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，用于高效进行核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署，通过兼容Triton核心语法并针对昇腾NPU特性进行深度优化，能够帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors to efficiently perform kernel autotuning, operator compilation, and deployment. It maintains compatibility with core Triton syntax and deeply optimizes for Ascend NPU features. This helps you quickly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend platform."

msgid "本文以**Ubuntu 22.04**环境下通过软件包部署方式在线安装并运行向量加法示例为例，指导用户快速上手使用**Triton-Ascend**。如需体验更多安装方式请阅读[安装指南](./installation_guide.md)文档。"
msgstr "This guide uses the vector addition sample to help you quickly get started with **Triton-Ascend**. The sample is installed and run online through software package deployment in an **Ubuntu 22.04** environment. For more installation methods, refer to the [Installation Guide](./installation_guide.md) document."

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Preparing the Environment"

msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware requirements**"

msgid "支持的操作系统：Linux（aarch64/x86_64）"
msgstr "Supported operating systems: Linux (aarch64/x86_64)"

msgid "支持的Ascend产品：Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品"
msgstr "Supported Ascend products: Atlas A2 products, Atlas A3 products, and Ascend 950PR&950DT products."

msgid "最小硬件配置：单卡32GB内存（推荐）"
msgstr "Minimum hardware configuration: Single device with 32 GB memory (recommended)"

msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

msgid "确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。其中，可以参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr "Determine and install the software versions of CANN, Python, and TorchNPU. To install the driver and firmware, refer to [CANN Quick Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download) on the Ascend community official website."

msgid "CANN版本：9.2.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.2.0"

msgid "Python版本：3.11"
msgstr "Python version: 3.11"

msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.10.0.post7"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.10.0.post7"

msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr "Note: For more compatibility information, refer to the [release notes table](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Installation"

msgid ""
"pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\n"
msgstr ""
"pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\n"

msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick start"

msgid "**运行tutorials中的向量加法示例验证结果**"
msgstr "**Run the vector addition sample in tutorials to verify the results**"

msgid "向量加法示例：[01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) 通过对比Triton算子与PyTorch原生计算的输出结果，证明昇腾NPU设备可正确调用Triton算子并保证计算精度。"
msgstr "Vector addition sample: [01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) proves that the Ascend NPU device can correctly call the Triton operator and ensure computation precision by comparing the output results of the Triton operator and the native PyTorch computation."

msgid "⚠️ 下述命令需在bash环境下执行。若使用POSIX sh，请将 `source` 替换为 `.`。"
msgstr "⚠️ Run the following commands in a bash environment. If you use POSIX sh, replace `source` with `.`."

msgid ""
"# 设置CANN环境变量（以root用户默认安装路径`/usr/local/Ascend`为例）\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"# 拉取triton-ascend源码仓及用例\n"
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"# 运行tutorials示例\n"
"python3 ./triton-ascend/third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py\n"
msgstr ""
"# Set CANN environment variables (using the default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` for the root user as an example)\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"# Clone the triton-ascend source repository and samples\n"
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"# Run the tutorial samples\n"
"python3 ./triton-ascend/third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py\n"

msgid "观察到类似的输出即说明环境配置正确。"
msgstr "If you see similar output, the environment is configured correctly."

msgid ""
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"The maximum difference between torch and triton is 0.0\n"
msgstr ""
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"The maximum difference between torch and triton is 0.0\n"

msgid "下一步：从样例到完整开发"
msgstr "Next step: from sample to full development"

msgid "本页帮助您完成安装与首个样例验证。若希望继续上手算子开发全流程，可按下面路径推进："
msgstr "This page helps you complete the installation and first sample verification. If you want to proceed with the full operator development workflow, follow the path below:"

msgid "**算子开发**：按算子类型阅读Vector / Cube / 融合开发教程，再对照典型样例修改Kernel，完成开发、编译、验证闭环。"
msgstr "**Operator development**: Read the Vector, Cube, or fusion development tutorial based on the operator type. Then modify the kernel by referring to typical samples to complete the development, compilation, and verification loop."

msgid "**自动调优**：使用Autotune选择合适的Tiling配置。"
msgstr "**Autotune**: Use Autotune to select an appropriate tiling configuration."

msgid "**调试与调优**：掌握打印调试与性能采集方法。"
msgstr "**Debugging and Tuning**: Master print debugging and performance collection methods."

msgid "**迁移与进阶**：从GPU Triton迁移到Ascend，或查阅环境变量与编译选项。"
msgstr "**Migration and Advanced Topics**: Migrate from GPU Triton to Ascend, or review environment variables and compilation options."

